==Strategy==
This stage revolves around trying to push you back with the spam of Thrillerz, so by playing near your base, it decreases most of the pressure the Thrillerz provide.

Remember to use the [[Cat Cannon|Breakerblast cannon]] to break the barrier of Le'Solar, as barrier breakers can struggle to reach her. As all of the enemies except Thrillerz will one shot your erasers, you should use 3 or 4 75c meatshields.

Attackers such as [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] can help to get rid of Thrillerz before they stack up.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] will help to chip down the elephants, and by playing near the base, will be safe from any stray Thrillerz.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can use the Thrillerz as stepping stones to deal chip damage to the elephants and the Owlbrows.
*Any unit with more than 410 range such as [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] will help with the cleanup of the elephants once you get enough money through killing an Owlbrow.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|Sarukani]]: His first form can help clear the Thrillerz as efficiently as Cyborg Cat, but with the advantage of Z-Killer!

